LMmultipass

LM Studio Multi-Model Orchestrator (LMSuite)

A lightweight local AI workflow tool for chaining multiple LLMs into configurable processing pipelines. Everything runs on your own machine through LM Studio's local server — no cloud APIs.

Status: Experimental · Current version: LMengine-v29 · Platform: built for Windows (Tkinter GUI)

What it does

LMSuite runs a multi-model roundtable. You give it a topic, pick two or more participants (each a different LM Studio model with its own role), and they take turns building on a shared transcript. When the discussion finishes, a Final Writer model turns the whole thing into a finished piece such as a story, a program, an article or a lesson.

